  description: 'To Special Summon "Uria, Lord of Searing Flames" using its own procedure,
    you can also use face-down Traps you control. Once per battle, when an attack
    is declared involving your "Uria, Lord of Searing Flames": You can send 1 Trap
    from your hand or Deck to the GY; its ATK/DEF become the number of face-up Traps
    on the field and in the GYs x 1000, for the rest of this turn. Once per turn:
    You can discard 1 card; add to your hand or Special Summon, 1 "Uria, Lord of
    Searing Flames", "Hamon, Lord of Striking Thunder", or "Raviel, Lord of Phantasms"
    from your GY, ignoring its Summoning conditions.'
